    "title": "USF overcomes foul troubles in OT win over Charlotte - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Keelin Fitzgerald, Correspondent ,\n1 days ago USF women’s basketball broke its two-game slide Tuesday night, locking down a 66-60 win in overtime against Charlotte at the Yuengling Center. The Bulls (13-9, 6-3 American) spent the last 30 seconds of the fourth battling it out, and ultimately tied it 53-53 after senior forward Carla Brito’s quick drive. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
